Description:
Implementation: [https://kentico.atlassian.net/browse/KX-12470](https://kentico.atlassian.net/browse/KX-12470)

The full changes can be found under `fe3797f5f804eb21fe141b7c1d2c2e5ecff383b4` in the xperience repository.

The linked issue introduces a new UI page that shows the assignments between reusable field schemas and content types.

Typical use case:

  * An administrator wants to see all content types consuming a specific reusable field schema

Notes

  * verify the exact labels/location/functionality in the xperience source code
  * draft a short release note and post it as part of the JIRA issue comment
  * also draft a short post to the training team about the feature

